Here’s what the You Aspirant website includes:
Public website
- Responsive pages for mobile, tablet, and desktop
- Career guidance and training information
- Student stories and testimonials, including YouTube video testimonials
- Blog previews and published articles
- Sticky enquiry and WhatsApp buttons
- Contact form for new student enquiries
Student features
- Create an account, sign in, and sign out
- View enquiries and replies from the You Aspirant team
- See which expert is assigned to an enquiry
- Reply to the team from the account page
- Check counselling request status
- Take a career assessment quiz
- Request an available counselling slot
Admin panel
- Sign in at /admin/login
- View and filter the enquiry inbox
- Open student conversations, reply, and assign experts
- Mark enquiries contacted, reopen them, or delete them
- Add experts and their specialties
- Publish counselling availability and manage booking requests
- Add or hide video testimonials
- See enquiry notifications; the dashboard refreshes its count every 15 seconds
Blog and SEO tools
- Create, edit, draft, and publish blog articles
- Set each article’s slug, SEO title, description, keywords, and search visibility
- Set default site title, description, keywords, and robots directive
- Add Google Search Console verification and a Google Analytics measurement ID
- Add trusted tracking or ad snippets in the page head or body
- Generate sitemap.xml and robots.txt automatically
- Use clean URLs such as /account, /quiz, and /blog without .php
